    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slimeicide \u2013 Game Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Character:</strong> Play as a nimble slime with agile, responsive movement designed for platforming and fast-paced combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong>\u00a0Many  distinct weapon types that impact how a player fights off enemies. Each has unique stats and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Mechanics:</strong> Includes a critical hit system that varies by weapon, rewarding skilled use of each weapon's potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> A full roster of weapon-themed enemies. Each enemy is designed as a mirror of the player's skill set with the weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Content:</strong> A procedurally generated tower with multiple floors. Each floor contains different enemy configurations and environmental hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Boss encounters every few floors that wield unique weapons and create challenging patterns for the player to skillfully weave.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Draw System:</strong> A random draw mechanic for weapons that adds replayability and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop System:</strong> A working in-game shop to purchase weapons for future runs using in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slimeicide \u2013 Game Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Character:</strong> Play as a nimble slime with agile, responsive movement designed for platforming and fast-paced combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons:</strong>\u00a0Many  distinct weapon types that impact how a player fights off enemies. Each has unique stats and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Mechanics:</strong> Includes a critical hit system that varies by weapon, rewarding skilled use of each weapon's potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> A full roster of weapon-themed enemies. Each enemy is designed as a mirror of the player's skill set with the weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Content:</strong> A procedurally generated tower with multiple floors. Each floor contains different enemy configurations and environmental hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Boss encounters every few floors that wield unique weapons and create challenging patterns for the player to skillfully weave.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Draw System:</strong> A random draw mechanic for weapons that adds replayability and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop System:</strong> A working in-game shop to purchase weapons for future runs using in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
